  "research_hypothesis": "The remaining standing-locomotion gap is an interaction between source-label semantics, person observability, and motion identifiability. Factorized targets and reliability-conditioned person/context evidence should improve visually identifiable cases; residual unidentifiable cases should benefit from temporal input or calibrated set-valued prediction.",
  "supervision_regimes": {
    "source_only": "No target-domain images or labels used for fitting, selection, or calibration.",
